                    augmentation to the training transform                      
                    to increase robustness to skin‐tone                         
                    variations without changing the model                       
                    architecture or training regimen. By                        
                    randomly adjusting brightness,                              
                    contrast, saturation, and hue during                        
                    training, we can help the model                             
                    generalize better across different                          
