                    Design: I propose to incorporate simple                     
                    test-time augmentation (TTA) by                             
                    averaging model predictions over the                        
                    original and horizontally flipped                           
                    versions of each validation image,                          
                    which can reduce prediction variance                        
                    and improve AUROC without changing the                      
                    training procedure. During each fold’s                      
