                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: I propose to address class                          
                    imbalance by using a weighted binary                        
                    cross-entropy loss with a per‐fold                          
                    positive class weight (pos_weight =                         
                    number of negatives / number of                             
                    positives). This will focus learning on                     
                    the malignant class and is likely to                        
                    improve overall AUROC. We compute                           
                    pos_weight from the training labels in                      
                    each CV split and also for the final                        
                    full‐data retraining. The rest of the                       
                    pipeline (ResNeXt50, transforms, CV,                        
                    fairness metrics, predict()) remains                        
                    unchanged.                                                  
