                    evaluation, we compute overall AUROC as                     
                    well as AUROCs for dark (skin_tone≤3)                       
                    and light (skin_tone≥5) subgroups and                       
                    report their mean gap to ensure                             
                    fairness. Each fold’s model is saved,                       
                    and a `predict()` function loads all                        
                    five models to average their malignancy                     
                    probabilities for new images.                               
                    Results: The training script executed                       
                    successfully without errors or bugs.                        
                    The model was trained using                                 
                    EfficientNet-B0 with a 5-fold                               
