                    inversely by its skin‐tone group                            
                    frequency, and compute overall AUROC as                     
                    well as the mean AUC gap between dark                       
                    and light skin subgroups. After                             
                    cross‐validation we retrain on the full                     
                    dataset with the same balanced sampler                      
                    and save the final model. The                               
