                    randomly adjusting brightness,                              
                    contrast, saturation, and hue during                        
                    training, we can help the model                             
                    generalize better across different skin                     
                    tones, potentially improving overall                        
                    AUROC and fairness. We integrate                            
                    ColorJitter into the train_transform                        
                    pipeline, rerun 5-fold cross-validation                     
