                    augmentation with a probability of 0.5                      
                    to the training pipeline, which can                         
                    regularize the model by randomly                            
                    occluding parts of the images and                           
                    improve generalization without altering                     
                    the architecture or training regimen.                       
                    We integrate `T.RandomErasing` after                        
