                    and dark (skin_tone≤3) subgroups. After                     
                    cross‐validation we retrain on the full                     
                    dataset and save the final model, and                       
                    provide a `predict()` function to infer                     
                    malignancy probabilities on new images.                     
                    The evaluation metric is the mean                           
                    cross‐validated AUROC.                                      
